#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:3
msgid "Upgrade to the firefox snap"
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:3
msgid ""
"Starting in Ubuntu 22.04, all new releases of firefox are only available to "
"Ubuntu users through the snap package."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:3
msgid ""
"This package update will transition your system over to the snap by "
"installing it."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:3
msgid ""
"It is recommended to close all open firefox windows before proceeding to the "
"upgrade."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:16
msgid "Unable to reach the snap store"
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:16
msgid ""
"Your system is unable to reach the snap store, please make sure you're "
"connected to the Internet and update any firewall or proxy settings as "
"needed so that you can reach the snap store."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:16
msgid ""
"You can manually check for connectivity by running \"snap info firefox\""
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:16
msgid ""
"Aborting will cause the upgrade to fail and will require it to be re-"
"attempted once snapd is functional on the system."
msgstr ""

#. Description
#: ../firefox.templates:16
msgid ""
"Skipping will let the package upgrade continue but firefox will not be "
"functional until the firefox snap is installed."
msgstr ""
